<aside class="kapi-callout kapi-callout-note kapi-tone-blue" data-kapi-preset="callout" role="note" data-kapi-id="c0000001"><div class="kapi-callout-label">Note</div><div class="kapi-callout-body" data-kapi-text="c0000001">Defaults to a note.</div></aside>
<aside class="kapi-callout kapi-callout-note kapi-tone-blue" data-kapi-preset="callout" role="note" data-kapi-id="c0000002"><div class="kapi-callout-label">Note</div><div class="kapi-callout-body" data-kapi-text="c0000002"><p>A note with <a href="#c0000001">a link</a>.</p></div></aside>
<aside class="kapi-callout kapi-callout-warning kapi-tone-yellow" data-kapi-preset="callout" role="note" data-kapi-id="c0000003" data-kapi-state="archived"><div class="kapi-callout-label">Warning</div><div class="kapi-callout-body" data-kapi-text="c0000003"><p>A warning.</p><ul><li>with a list</li></ul></div></aside>
<aside class="kapi-callout kapi-callout-key kapi-tone-purple" data-kapi-preset="callout" role="note" data-kapi-id="c0000004"><div class="kapi-callout-label">Key point</div><div class="kapi-callout-body" data-kapi-text="c0000004"><p>The key point.</p></div></aside>
<div class="kapi-error" data-kapi-preset="callout" role="alert" data-kapi-id="c0000005"><span class="kapi-error-tag">&lt;kapi-callout&gt;</span> kind must be note, warning, key, danger or success, not "alarm"</div>
<aside class="kapi-callout kapi-callout-danger kapi-tone-red" data-kapi-preset="callout" role="note" data-kapi-id="c0000006"><div class="kapi-callout-label">Danger</div><div class="kapi-callout-body" data-kapi-text="c0000006"><p>This drops the table.</p></div></aside>
<aside class="kapi-callout kapi-callout-success kapi-tone-green" data-kapi-preset="callout" role="note" data-kapi-id="c0000007"><div class="kapi-callout-label">Success</div><div class="kapi-callout-body" data-kapi-text="c0000007"><p>All shards copied.</p></div></aside>
